[statement]
Names provided by other packages are decided one at a time, in the order a
depth-first walk of the dependencies reaches them. Here `app` reaches the
virtual `v` through `A`, listed first, before `w` through `B`: `v` is
decided before `kw` is installed for `w`, and goes to `gk`, of higher
priority. The shape of the Alpine KDE case
(`reduced/akonadi-calendar-takes-gnome-keyring`).

[repository]
P:app
V:1
D:A B

P:pa
V:1
p:A=1
D:v

P:pb
V:1
p:B=1
D:w

P:kw
V:1
p:v w=1

P:gk
V:1
p:v
k:100

[request]
app

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
install gk 1
install pa 1
install kw 1
install pb 1
install app 1
